+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
+/*
+ * Device Tree Source for the HiHope RZ/G2M sub board connected to an
+ * Advantech IDK-1110WR 10.1" LVDS panel
+ *
+ * Copyright (C) 2020 Renesas Electronics Corp.
+ */
